usage: qp [-h] [--list] [--compare] [--json] [--batch BATCH] [--all]
          [targets ...]

qp — Quantum Physical Predictor (MoDoT-grounded)

positional arguments:
  targets        Catalog names or IG tuples

options:
  -h, --help     show this help message and exit
  --list         List catalog entries with predictions
  --compare      Compare multiple targets side by side
  --json         JSON output
  --batch BATCH  Batch file with one target per line
  --all          Predict for ALL catalog entries

Examples:
  qp magnetar                    # Predict from catalog
  qp '<𐑛𐑡𐑽𐑗𐑐𐑧𐑚𐑝𐑢𐑒𐑙𐑷>'         # Predict from inline tuple
  qp --compare magnetar bec      # Compare two systems
  qp --json magnetar > out.json  # JSON output
